<title>FRANCE: TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-PARIS OPEN RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the $2.55 million Paris</p>
<p>Open tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Third round</p>
<p>Magnus Gustafsson (Sweden) beat 8-Wayne Ferreira (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) beat 11-Todd Martin (U.S.) 6-4 3-6</p>
<p>7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Marc Rosset (Switzerland) beat 16-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 7-5</p>
<p>3-6 7-6 (7-2)</p>
<p>Stefan Edberg (Sweden) beat Fernand Wibier (Netherlands) 4-6</p>
<p>6-4 6-2</p>
<p>4-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia) beat 13-MaliVai Washington (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Petr Korda (Czech Republic) beat Alberto Berasategui (Spain)</p>
<p>6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Arnaud Boestch (France) beat 2-Michael Chang (U.S.) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>12-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Carlos Moya (Spain) 6-2 7-6</p>
<p>(7-4)</p>
</text>
